                        "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                        "entry_id": "ba62a8c7-34cf-3486-8cb2-27f1024552e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterised or marked by danger; dangerous."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6471bf5a-2ca0-473c-b963-c42cb93f35b6",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "All that was familiar and trustworthy was back there, where the sun was sinking. To the east lay the unimaginable, the dangerous, and the wearisome; and a feeling of timidity came over his bold heart: this water world was dangersome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d95bafa2-56d8-4c10-84bd-ae3541873db9",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "“I'm just sayin' she's more dangersome than you think.” Han's head came up in surprise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cb5efb2-7abf-4ff0-98dd-1dcf5bbf4873",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "I'll trust you, sir; but my work is dangersome, and please God I should get killed, will you do the same for Martha and little Nan?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "042fa53b-e85f-4162-bf10-9afbcf65d8c8",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "Going after him now, with the train slowed down and everyone standing up to get off, would be a dangersome waste of time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a112c8a9-543f-4772-8d1c-c00b2c07e84b",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "“Fuck. Was. That?” “P-Prolly j-jus' a wolf” stuttered Zeth, before remembering the animal may be demonic, before further remembering even without possession wolves were dangersome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddeb9f3a-f86f-4255-a7d4-54594544a778",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "“Just plain vile. I felt I should have been fighting, not doing road work. I ain't no logger. And dangersome, too, that work was. I seen one man from the 16th nigh chop his foot off when he mis-swung his axe. Couple others got killed when them big pines fell on them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4303bf65-98b9-4d8c-b499-ec3de7887d17",
                                "sense_id": "927518e8-b9a6-39ff-a0c9-3a745eb1959f",
                                "text": "“Roots. Bark. Horror. This sounds dangersome,” said Desdemona Cork as she helped herself to a pork rib. “I like it not and will have no part of it.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
